fficial_name":"皇后","official_note":"皇后是皇帝的正妻，在汉代是后宫最高位，此处指皇后的母亲被封为舞阳君，皇后本身是官职或身份，但原文中皇后作为修饰语出现，表示其母的身份。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"皇后母","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"0307dd51-9733-457f-b052-7a8e3330b6c8"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"封爵","official_name":"舞陽君","official_note":"舞阳君是封号，通常授予皇室或贵族女性，表示爵位或荣誉头衔，在汉代可能对应君侯之类的封爵，此处用于封赏皇后的母亲。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"舞陽君","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"97d2eac9-7cfe-4e13-9850-0f75d35837ca"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":189,"link_td_description":"何进，字遂高，南阳宛县（今河南省南阳市）人，东汉末年外戚，官至大将军，录尚书事，封慎侯。何进为了对付十常侍而召董卓率军队入京，成为东汉末年直至三国割据的重要事件之一，而自己也被十常侍杀死。","link_td_id":"Q10001052","link_td_number_id":138554,"people_name":"舞陽君","people_name_jianti_auto":"舞阳君","people_xingming":"舞阳君","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"97a4ec79-db0e-11ef-9b28-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3爵號皇后母爲舞陽君。","content_fanyi":"封何皇后之母为舞阳君。","content_jianti_auto":"3爵号皇后母为舞阳君。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4993,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"97a4ec78-db0e-11ef-b5c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"金城河","place_name_jianti_auto":"金城河","resolved_place_entity_id":9458,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"97a4ec7b-db0e-11ef-b346-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、临洮府（卷六十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...恐为敌所遮，夜遣三校衔枚先度，度辄营陈，会明毕度，是也。","source_end_index":184,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"27684762-7797-5d8c-b