。在此段中，封諝、徐奉担任此职，被黄巾军利用为内应，反映了东汉末年宦官干政的腐败现象。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以中常侍封諝、徐奉等爲內應","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"84702e90-91e1-49a2-b9f2-cc5763e99b80"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":184,"link_td_description":"张角，钜鹿人。东汉末年太平道首领、黄巾之乱领导人。叛乱很快被汉朝剿灭，张角病死。","link_td_id":"Q10000521","link_td_number_id":107038,"people_name":"角","people_name_jianti_auto":"角","people_xingming":"张角","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecbb-db0e-11ef-82cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馬元義","people_name_jianti_auto":"马元义","people_xingming":"马元义","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecbd-db0e-11ef-ac42-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"元義","people_name_jianti_auto":"元义","people_xingming":"马元义","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecbe-db0e-11ef-86fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":184,"link_td_description":"封谞，东汉宦官，官至中常侍，作为黄巾之乱内应事泄而被杀。","link_td_id":"Q10007706","link_td_number_id":6001982,"people_name":"封諝","people_name_jianti_auto":"封谞","people_xingming":"封谞","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecc3-db0e-11ef-a51f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"徐奉","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐奉","people_xingming":"徐奉","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecc4-db0e-11ef-8787-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京城","place_name_jianti_auto":"京城","resolved_place_entity_id":409,"start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecbc-db0e-11ef-8c83-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆","resolved_place_entity_id":103,"start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecbf-db0e-11ef-9356-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"揚","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬","resolved_place_entity_id":419,"start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecc0-db0e-11ef-892f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄴","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺","resolved_place_entity_id":101,"start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecc1-db0e-11ef-9339-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":56,"start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecc2-db0e-11ef-8ee2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"黄巾起义","tongjian_id":"war_N0619"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"角遂置三十六方；方，猶將軍也，大方萬餘人，小方六七千，各立渠帥；訛言「蒼天已死，黃天當立，歲在甲子，天下大吉。」以白土書京城寺門及州郡官府，皆作「甲子」字。大方馬元義等先收荊、揚數萬人，期會發於鄴。元義數往來京師，以中常侍封諝、徐奉等爲內應，約以三月五日內外俱起。","content_fanyi":"张角于是设置三十六方；方，如同将军，大方一万余人，小方六七千人，各自设立首领；他们散布谣言说：“苍天已死，黄天当立，岁在甲子，天下大吉。”用白土在京城洛阳各官署和州郡官府的大门上，都写上“甲子”二字。大方马元义等先聚集荆、扬两州数万人，约定时间在邺城起事。马元义多次来往京城洛阳，策动中常侍封谞、徐奉等作为内应，约定在次年甲子年的三月五日内外同时起事。","content_jianti_auto":"角遂置三十六方；方，犹将军也，大方万余人，小方六七千，各立渠帅；讹言「苍天已死，黄天当立，岁在甲子，天下大吉。」以白土书京城寺门及州郡官府，皆作「甲子」字。大方马元义等先收荆、扬数万人，期会发于邺。元义数往来京师，以中常侍封谞、徐奉等为内应，约以三月五日内外俱起。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4998,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"97a4ecaf-db0e-11ef-a2a0-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"六年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"六年","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"97a2a2f6-db0e-11ef-a145-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（癸亥、一八三）","year_int":183},"message":"success","success":true}